    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU DIE TODAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dungeon-crawling adventure that combines the strategic depth of deck-building with the thrill of rolling dice. Inspired by the magic of tabletop RPGs, this game brings you a unique rogue-like experience where every roll counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/ea722fdf3913412071cfd70581af8e49.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/ea722fdf3913412071cfd70581af8e49.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/ea722fdf3913412071cfd70581af8e49.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/13bff8dd17a63454681a79a5e9e17788.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/13bff8dd17a63454681a79a5e9e17788.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/13bff8dd17a63454681a79a5e9e17788.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building with a Twist:</strong> Collect powerful cards with unique abilities and build your ultimate deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/53d6405f53489f8243631af8367b0012.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/53d6405f53489f8243631af8367b0012.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/53d6405f53489f8243631af8367b0012.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice of All Kinds:</strong> Use D4s, D6s, D8s, D12s, and even D20s to unleash devastating effects. The dice you roll can trigger card effects, grant extra bonuses, or turn the tide in encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/388bca920386a6c32b1418ca9ee4d272.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/388bca920386a6c32b1418ca9ee4d272.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/388bca920386a6c32b1418ca9ee4d272.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop-Inspired Gameplay:</strong> Feel the excitement of rolling dice and making critical decisions, just like in classic tabletop fantasy games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/23ab2b3c37d81f845e34d85813721321.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/23ab2b3c37d81f845e34d85813721321.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/23ab2b3c37d81f845e34d85813721321.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters:</strong> Face off against fantastical foes, tackle challenges, and discover secrets hidden in the dungeon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/d63045aa8d8701d8b08c6b62c9264797.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/d63045aa8d8701d8b08c6b62c9264797.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/d63045aa8d8701d8b08c6b62c9264797.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Each run offers a new combination of cards, dice, and choices, ensuring no two adventures are alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/b053bbdc9d423c1c2cdd44912e467dec.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/b053bbdc9d423c1c2cdd44912e467dec.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/b053bbdc9d423c1c2cdd44912e467dec.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/8fc4f1d4181148a5b59263f49cc8ac45.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/8fc4f1d4181148a5b59263f49cc8ac45.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/8fc4f1d4181148a5b59263f49cc8ac45.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you forge your path to victory or will the dungeon claim you? Test your strategy and luck in this fresh take on the rogue-like genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/cb5e7986bd34f2dec5f7ee34daf735a7.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/cb5e7986bd34f2dec5f7ee34daf735a7.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/cb5e7986bd34f2dec5f7ee34daf735a7.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why This Game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love the strategic depth of card games, the thrill of rolling dice, and the immersive storytelling of games like <i>Dungeons &amp; Dragons</i> or <i>Baldur\u2019s Gate 3</i>, this game is designed for you. We've crafted a unique experience that captures the spirit of tabletop fantasy and brings it to life in a rogue-like format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/0401e0ae7f7d3dcfec555beb9e7768b8.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/0401e0ae7f7d3dcfec555beb9e7768b8.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/0401e0ae7f7d3dcfec555beb9e7768b8.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/9815706f6f0cbde9213ce3bf1ed0a900.poster.avif?t=1751881435\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/9815706f6f0cbde9213ce3bf1ed0a900.webm?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/9815706f6f0cbde9213ce3bf1ed0a900.mp4?t=1751881435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will &quot;<strong><i>YOU DIE TODAY</i></strong>&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/